# mcp-tool-rugpull-gate has no settings, and by design it shouldn't need an API key: it
# reads tools/list JSON files and a lock file on your machine, makes no network call and
# starts no server.
#
# If a later version adds a setting (a default lock-file path, say), its name goes here
# with where to get its value, never the value. Copy this file to .env at the repo root
# to set it; the real environment wins over the file.
